   "source": [
    "### Round 3 — DeepSeek-R1 (glass box by default)\n",
    "DeepSeek-R1 always emits its reasoning in `<think>` tags. This is its natural glass-box mode."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
